texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> with the usual\naddition and multiplication is not a field. Name two axioms that fail,\neach with a witness.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch00-foundations/07-fields.html"}